The '''Sewer''' is a [[Location]] underneath the {{Zone|Village}} on the [[Hub Island]]. It can be accessed from several different points, including the [[Hub Well]] just right of spawn.

{{ZoneText|&fMay contain rats.}}

== Purpose ==
The '''Sewer''' allows players to kill {{MobSprite|Rat}}s, which drop {{Item|Tasty Cheese}}.

During the [[Great Spook]], {{Item|Sewer Fish}} can be caught in the '''Sewer'''.

